   :producer "futon2.report.war-machine/graph-summary"
   :producer-at "scripts/futon2/report/war_machine.clj:3822-3823"
   :producer-range :bounded-by-construction
   :producer-range-argument ":active-repos is (count (filter :active? repos)) and :total-repos is (count repos), so the numerator counts a subset of what the denominator counts."
   :note "This is the only channel observe COMPUTES rather than passes through and does not cap, and the only one whose reference cannot be evaluated on an input the node accepts: observe reads (:total-repos summary) at observation.clj:129 with no default, so a present-but-incomplete summary raises before any of the fourteen coordinates is returned."}

  {:channel :sorry-count-norm
   :declared-at "src/futon2/aif/observation.clj:27"
