   :producer-range :bounded-by-the-node
   :producer-range-argument "The producer emits (count coupling) with no relation to n(n-1)/2 enforced there. The upper bound comes from the node's own (min 1.0 ...) at observation.clj:137."
   :note "Reads the SAME source key as :active-repo-ratio -- [:graph :summary :total-repos] -- but at observation.clj:134 with an explicit 0 default. The one-character difference between the two reads is what makes one channel total and the other partial."}

